# The Deno CI runs. denoland/setup-deno reads it through
# `deno-version-file`, and asdf and mise read the same file, so a machine
# with either switches to it the way rustup switches on rust-toolchain.toml.
# Deno has no rustup: without one of those this is a number to upgrade to
# rather than one that arrives.
deno 2.9.7

# The repository's Python scripts take the standard library alone, and
# tomllib from 3.11.
python 3.12
